From: Taimoor Ul Islam <tislam@iastate.edu>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 17:13:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 16/52] kaiair: PktR metrics JSON egress for the co-design GUI
 (step 3)

The metrics view now emits one machine-readable telemetry record per interval to
KAIAIR_PKTR_METRICS_JSON (agent serves it at GET /metrics): ul_sinr/rsrp/ni,
e_max, tpc, dl_cqi/bler, ul_delay (SR->PUSCH), k/er (GRK), ul/dl throughput, and a
provisional eco_ratio (delivered kbps per PRB). Written atomically (tmp+rename);
absent fields are JSON null. No-op when the env var is unset (backward compatible).

Verified on HW: /metrics returned live per-interval data with an attached UE.
